a ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.vogue.com/article/celebrities-married-to-normal-people\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d84\"},\"ref\":\"d84\",\"snippet\":\" ... Grey's Anatomy (2005–14)\\n\\nFrom 2005 to 2014, Oh played Dr. Cristina Yang in the ABC medical drama series Grey's Anatomy. Oh's portrayal of the pragmatic, ambitious Yang earned her five Primetime Emmy nominations for Best Supporting Actress in a Drama Series. She was one ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.thecanadianencyclopedia.ca/en/article/sandra-oh\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d85\"},\"ref\":\"d85\",\"snippet\":\" ... As with Grey's Anatomy and The Good Wife, the characters' relationships are just as important as their jobs.\\n\\n'Extraordinary Attorney Woo' (2022)\\n\\nWoo Young-woo (played by Park Eun-bin) is a young law prodigy, who graduated from the best school at the top of her class ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.marieclaire.com/culture/a26895105/best-korean-dramas/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"aa1079f99342f933b4e5c2fd5e42104a3cdf66a3b64e593858ba288fefcd8db1\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"1d288f8bba8c46214a903248f1fc0ac6fb6f1a51486584f292690874a96957af\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"character married three times one child survives Grey's Anatomy\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d86\"},\"ref\":\"d86\",\"snippet\":\" ... He joined NIS, which later became NCIS, after his wife Shannon and only daughter