":{\"ref\":\"d89\"},\"ref\":\"d89\",\"snippet\":\" ... in that child. Genetic changes can include broken, missing, rearranged, or extra chromosomes as well as gene variants. One such alteration is trisomy 21, or the presence of an extra copy of chromosome 21, which causes Down syndrome. Children with Down syndrome are 10–20 times more likely ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cancer.gov/types/childhood-cancers/child-adolescent-cancers-fact-sheet\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d90\"},\"ref\":\"d90\",\"snippet\":\" ... Amelia Heinle Amelia Heinle has been married to her former Y&R costar Thad Luckinbill , aka J.T. Hellstrom, since 2007. They have two children together, son Thaddeus and daughter Georgia.\\n\\nThe actress, who plays Victoria Newman on the soap, was previously married to NCIS alum Michael Weatherly ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.swooon.com/gallery/young-and-the-restless-stars-real-life-relationships-couples-dating-history/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d76\"},\"ref\":\"d76\",\"snippet\":\" ... No one could have envisioned that the characters introduced on \\\"Perfect Strangers\\\" would center a series that survived for nine seasons, becoming at the time in the 1990s the second-longest-running live action American sitcom with a predominantly African American cast (behind only \\\"The Jeffersons,\\\" which ran ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goldderby.com/gallery/best-tv-spinoffs-ranked/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d91\"},\"ref\":\"d91\",\"snippet\":\" ... on Three's Company & the one season spin-off, Three's A Crowd, as well as having watched Hearts Afire and I'd spent years watching Benjamin as Hal M